{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7457f21a-299c-4ae3-8995-68a6dab0e5f3",
    "name": "FilmLog API",
    "description": "# FilmLog API\n\nFilmLog is a movie watchlist REST API built with Laravel. It provides user authentication, movie catalog browsing, personal watchlists, watched-movie reviews, statistics, and AI-powered movie recommendations using Google Gemini.\n\n## Getting Started\n1. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable to your local API URL. The default value is `http://localhost:8000/api`.\n2. Send a **Register** request using a unique email address.\n3. Send a **Login** request. After a successful login, the JWT access token is automatically saved to the `token` collection variable.\n4. Use the protected endpoints. Their Bearer Token authorization is configured to use `{{token}}`.\n\n## Authentication\nProtected endpoints require a valid JWT access token in the Authorization header:\n`Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n## Collection Variables\n- `baseUrl`: Base URL of the FilmLog API.\n- `token`: JWT access token saved automatically after a successful login.\n- `movieId`: Movie ID used by movie-specific requests.\n\n## Notes\n- Make sure the Laravel backend server is running before sending requests.\n- A valid Gemini API key and a non-empty local movie catalog are required for successful AI recommendations.\n- Registration requires a unique email address. Use a test account when exploring the API.\n- Requests that create or delete records will modify the authenticated user's data.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "59593853"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"filmuser\",\n  \"email\": \"filmuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user account. Provide a unique username and email address, and a password containing at least 8 characters. A successful request returns HTTP 201 Created."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (response.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', response.token);",
                  "        console.log('JWT token saved to collection variable: token');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        console.warn('Login succeeded, but response.token was not found. Check AuthController response.');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"filmuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with an email address and password. A successful request returns HTTP 200 OK and a JWT token. The test script automatically saves the response `token` value to the collection variable."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Endpoints for creating a user account and obtaining a JWT access token."
    },
    {
      "name": "Movies",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Movies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve the movie catalog. This endpoint is public and does not require authentication."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Movies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies?search=batman",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "batman"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Search the movie catalog by title using the `search` query parameter. Change the sample value as needed."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Filter Movies by Genre",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=Action",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "genre",
                  "value": "Action"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filter the movie catalog by genre using the `genre` query parameter. Change the sample value to a genre available in the catalog."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Random Movies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies?random=true",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "random",
                  "value": "true"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve movies in randomized order by setting the `random` query parameter to `true`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Movie by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies/{{movieId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies",
                "{{movieId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve the details of a specific movie. Set the `movieId` collection variable to an existing movie ID."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Gemini Recommendation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"I want a thoughtful science-fiction movie with an interesting story.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies/recommend",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies",
                "recommend"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Request one movie recommendation based on the supplied prompt. The recommendation is grounded in the local movie catalog. A valid Gemini API key and a non-empty movie catalog are required."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Public endpoints for browsing the movie catalog, searching and filtering movies, retrieving movie details, and requesting AI-powered recommendations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Watchlist",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Watchlist",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/watchlist",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "watchlist"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve the authenticated user's watchlist. Requires a valid JWT access token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Movie to Watchlist",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
